# WP-PACKED-PREFAB: a packed prefab instance (UE 5.5 APackedLevelActor) draws its prefab's packed form - one
# InstancedStaticMesh per (mesh, material slots, primitive, shadow flags) - and follows its source when the source is
# applied from an instance unpacked to edit.
#
# Content (authored once, before the first run; content, not code): Content/Prefabs/Fence_Run.deprefab = an empty
# root "Fence_Run" with 20 posts (Post_01..Post_20, one post mesh) and 20 boards (Board_01..Board_20, one board mesh)
# as its direct children: 2 mesh groups, 40 instances. Content/Scenes/WP_PackedPrefab.desce holds 10 instances of it
# in a row, saved unpacked, the camera looking along the row. Every name is unique INSIDE the prefab, so once one
# instance is unpacked "Board_10" names exactly one entity (the packed ones draw it as an instance of "Board_01 x20").
#
# What is proven: [packed_draws] packing leaves the picture as it was and the frame's static draws fall from one per
# post/board to one per mesh group; Details of the selected instance read "Packed: 2 ISM". [packed_redo] a redone Pack
# is packed again (rebuilt from the prefab, not from a snapshot). [packed_reload] the mode survives a save and a
# reopen ("PrefabPacked": true on each record). [packed_repacked] Unpack to edit one instance -> delete its Board_10
# -> Apply to Prefab: the 9 instances that stayed packed are rebuilt from the new form and lose board 10 too.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_PackedPrefab.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Fence_Run"
Дано run Entity "Select all instances of the same prefab"
Тогда packed_before десять экземпляров Fence_Run стоят в ряд раскрытыми: 400 статических мешей (по одному на столб и доску), выделены все десять корней
Когда run Entity "Pack Prefab Instances"
Дано run Panel "Details"
Тогда packed_draws забор выглядит как на packed_before (та же геометрия, те же материалы и тени); статических draw — по одному на группу (2 ISM на экземпляр) вместо 40; Details выбранного экземпляра «Packed: 2 ISM»; в логе «[Prefab] 10 instance(s) packed.»
Когда run Action "Undo"
Тогда packed_undo одна отмена: экземпляры снова раскрыты (40 сущностей под каждым корнем), картинка как на packed_before
Когда run Action "Redo"
Тогда packed_redo повтор: экземпляры снова упакованы, Details «Packed: 2 ISM», картинка как на packed_draws, в логе нет «[Prefab] ... failed»
Когда run Action "Save Scene"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Когда run Scene "Open Scene WP_PackedPrefab.desce"
Дано run Entity "Fence_Run"
Дано run Panel "Details"
Тогда packed_reload после повторного открытия экземпляры упакованы (Details «Packed: 2 ISM»; у записей в .desce "PrefabPacked": true и нет PrefabOverrides), картинка как на packed_draws
Когда run Entity "Unpack Prefab Instances to Edit"
Когда run Entity "Delete Board_10"
Дано run Entity "Post_10"
Когда run Entity "Apply to Prefab"
Тогда packed_repacked у всех 10 экземпляров нет доски 10 (у 9 упакованных — пересобраны из новой формы: в логе 9 строк «changed (source …): a packed instance is rebuilt from 2 group(s)»); Details упакованного экземпляра «Packed: 2 ISM», 39 экземпляров в его группах
